&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About&amp;nbsp;AlayaCare&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16579836,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;AlayaCare,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;more than just a fast-growing SaaS&amp;nbsp;company,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;a team of people passionate about transforming home healthcare. Our cloud-based platform empowers care providers around the world to deliver better outcomes for their clients.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16579836,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With 550+ employees across Canada, the US, Australia, and Brazil,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;united by a shared mission and a strong culture of transparency, growth, and human connection. Whether&amp;nbsp;you&#39;re&amp;nbsp;early in your career or a seasoned expert,&amp;nbsp;AlayaCare&amp;nbsp;offers the opportunity to grow your impact, your skills, and your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16579836,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Fullstack Developer (Python) to join our Admission &amp;amp; Marketplace team. You’ll contribute to meaningful projects while learning modern development practices, tools, and workflows, and be supported by mentors who will help you develop both your technical abilities and professional skills. The Admission &amp;amp; Marketplace initiative in AlayaCare Cloud streamlines referrals, intake coordination, and care planning while enabling providers to collaborate across agencies. By eliminating manual processes like phone calls and faxes, and by empowering agencies to subcontract efficiently, these tools accelerate scheduling, strengthen partnerships, and improve outcomes for businesses, care workers, and clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;On the Client Intake front, help transform how home care referrals are received, processed, and coordinated through completely rebuilt intake workflow built around agentic capabilities. Streamline intake operations, reduce manual work, and help agencies move clients into care faster, improving efficiency for care teams and outcomes for clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With the Marketplace offering, extend the future of collaboration between care providers. Work on a new Supplier Portal&amp;nbsp;project that simplifies provider onboarding, profile management, and connections between agencies with care needs and available capacity. Unlock new markets, reduce administrative effort, and strengthen partnerships across the home care ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16579836,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Design, code, test, and debug software as a full-time member of a product development team, with a strong focus on quality, maintainability, and reliable delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Spend 75% or more of your time coding and contributing directly to the team’s deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Participate actively in code reviews, technical discussions, knowledge-sharing, and collaborative problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
